{block name="title"}achilles - a study of flavor enhancers{/block}
{block name="content"}
<div class="blurb">
<div class="header"><h1>achilles</h1></div>
<div class="body">
<h2>a study of flavor enhancers and food additives</h2>

<p>project achilles studies flavors enhancers, especially <abbr title="monosodium glutamate">MSG</abbr>
and related compounds (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disodium_glutamate">disodium glutamate</a>, disodium glutayate, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disodium_guanylate">disodium guanylate</a>, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disodium_inosinate">disodium inosinate</a>, etc) on the human body.</p>
</div> {* body *}
</div> {* blurb *}
<div class="blurb">
<div class="header warning"><h1>warning</h1></div>
<div class="body"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
<span>For <b>medical</b> or <b>nutritional advice</b>, <i>do not rely only on this
site</i>. Please <b>consult a dietician or health care professional</b> instead.</span>
</div>
